@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89431
+notes:
+  aiprovider_gemini:
+    - message: >-
+        The "Generate image" action now supports the Gemini native image
+        generation protocol (":generateContent" endpoint with
+        responseModalities IMAGE) in addition to the Imagen ":predict" protocol.
+        New model classes `gemini31flashimage`, `gemini31flashliteimage` and
+        `gemini3proimage` have been added, and `gemini-3.1-flash-image` is now
+        the default image model. A new `gemini_image_base` interface lets image
+        model classes declare which protocol they use. The Imagen 4 endpoints
+        are being retired by Google on 17 August 2026; sites still configured
+        with `imagen-4.0-generate-001` should switch to one of the Gemini image
+        models.
+      type: changed
